@startuml sequence_login_v2
title シーケンス図: ログイン(OIDC Authorization Code + PKCE、BFFパターン)

actor "ブラウザ(React)" as Browser
participant "bff: auth handler" as BFF
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "Keycloak" as KC
participant "backend" as Backend

Browser -> BFF : GET /api/me (未ログイン)
BFF --> Browser : 401

Browser -> BFF : GET /api/auth/login?redirect=/tasks
BFF -> BFF : state/nonce/code_verifier生成
BFF -> Redis : SET tmp state (TTL数分)
BFF --> Browser : 302 Keycloak Authorization Endpoint

Browser -> KC : ログイン画面で認証
KC --> Browser : 302 /api/auth/callback?code=...&state=...

Browser -> BFF : GET /api/auth/callback?code=...&state=...
BFF -> Redis : state検証・取得
BFF -> KC : POST /token (code, code_verifier)
KC --> BFF : access_token / refresh_token / id_token
BFF -> BFF : iss/aud/exp/nonce検証
BFF -> Backend : JITプロビジョニング(keycloak_sub, name, email)
Backend --> BFF : users行(upsert済み)
BFF -> BFF : sessionID(UUIDv4)発行
BFF -> Redis : SET session:{sessionID} (TTL=refresh_token有効期限)
BFF --> Browser : Set-Cookie session_id(HttpOnly/Secure/SameSite=Lax)\n302 redirectへ

Browser -> BFF : GET /api/me (Cookie送信)
BFF -> Redis : GET session:{sessionID}
BFF --> Browser : 200 { user, feature_flags }
@enduml
